==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zroco]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*8 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*8 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*5 [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*7 [[Znache]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*4 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*3 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
*2 [[Razorback]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
*1 [[Henry]] spawns as the boss after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Rush down Henry with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N005 (Special Cat)|Hitman Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and other heavy hitters so he won't get in your way. If you are fast enough, you can beat this stage before Razorback even spawns, but always have a flow of [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]—preferably with a Freeze Effect Up (M) [[Cat Combo]], so if Razorback does show up you won't immediately lose. Talented [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T]] is very good here as your anti-Dark damage dealer, since its high speed allows it to get in Henry's blind spot with ease. The [[:Category:Zombie Enemies|Zombie]] peons here are also not too harsh, so [[Ancient Egg: N107 (Rare Cat)|Cat Chief]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Cadaver BearCat]] are enough to deal with them.

